WEBVTT

00:01:35.418 --> 00:01:36.942
Feel the pain.

00:01:37.019 --> 00:01:39.783
Yes, human suffering.

00:01:39.855 --> 00:01:41.288
It's such a unique privilege...

00:01:41.357 --> 00:01:43.518
of being a human being,
isn't it?

00:02:00.276 --> 00:02:03.040
Hey, chick,
you cannot go anywhere.

00:02:03.112 --> 00:02:05.979
There's no place you can hide.

00:02:06.048 --> 00:02:09.449
Let's go somewhere
more fun together.

00:02:09.518 --> 00:02:13.249
Remember,
we're brother and sister.

00:02:22.064 --> 00:02:25.397
There is a new development
in the antirobot movement.

00:02:25.468 --> 00:02:28.403
The MPD confirmed
there is a connection...

00:02:28.471 --> 00:02:31.406
between two detectives and
the terrorist activities...

00:02:31.474 --> 00:02:35.410
in St. Lowell Airport,
as well as Shinora Hospital.

00:02:35.478 --> 00:02:39.073
The MPD is trying to locate
the two detectives...

00:02:39.148 --> 00:02:43.312
Naomi Armitage
and Ross Sylibus, as suspects.

00:02:58.067 --> 00:03:01.036
I am not used to this kind
of stuff, you know.

00:03:01.103 --> 00:03:04.698
You've got to do it
the easy way for me.

00:03:04.773 --> 00:03:06.934
They reported about us
as if we were criminals.

00:03:07.009 --> 00:03:08.442
"As if" you were?

00:03:08.511 --> 00:03:10.445
What do you think
you're supposed to be?

00:03:10.513 --> 00:03:12.504
Did you find anything about
the place where Asakura is?

00:03:12.581 --> 00:03:15.744
Yeah, I found something
fishy about Danich Hill.

00:03:17.052 --> 00:03:19.452
There's a highway
in the middle of the area...

00:03:19.522 --> 00:03:21.456
and there's
an unidentified area...

00:03:21.524 --> 00:03:24.186
on the side of the highway.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.693
Unidentified?

00:03:25.761 --> 00:03:26.887
Yeah.

00:03:26.962 --> 00:03:31.228
I bet the real Martians
are still inhabiting there.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.892
Hey, what are you doing?

00:03:32.968 --> 00:03:34.458
A loss, in duty.

00:03:34.537 --> 00:03:36.129
Yeah, the dearly departed.

00:03:36.205 --> 00:03:37.365
Sorry. See you.

00:03:38.507 --> 00:03:39.906
Hey, Sylibus!

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:45.803
Are you going
to go visit Martians?

00:03:45.881 --> 00:03:48.042
I am.

00:03:48.117 --> 00:03:50.847
I always wanted to see them
since I was a kid.

00:04:04.133 --> 00:04:06.363
Are you O. K?

00:04:06.435 --> 00:04:09.996
No, I'm not.
My CPU's all messed up.

00:04:10.072 --> 00:04:14.008
I think my life
will be over soon.

00:04:14.076 --> 00:04:16.704
You forgot you're a machine?

00:04:16.779 --> 00:04:19.441
Even a machine
doesn't live forever.

00:04:19.515 --> 00:04:21.915
My life is pretty short,
though.

00:04:24.086 --> 00:04:26.646
Hey, how come?
- What?

00:04:26.722 --> 00:04:30.988
You're a wanted man now
because of me.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.587
How come you're driving me
all the way to Asakura?

00:04:34.663 --> 00:04:37.962
Why are you hanging out with me?

00:04:40.336 --> 00:04:42.395
Why...
- Stop it!

00:04:42.471 --> 00:04:45.372
You're asking stupid questions
like a little kid.

00:04:47.409 --> 00:04:50.003
I don't know myself.

00:05:04.893 --> 00:05:06.554
That's it, isn't it?

00:05:06.629 --> 00:05:08.597
Tell me our current location.

00:05:11.533 --> 00:05:12.966
This is the facility...

00:05:13.035 --> 00:05:16.004
that has been deleted
from the map.

00:05:53.509 --> 00:05:55.909
Dr. Asakura!

00:05:55.978 --> 00:05:58.105
Where are you?

00:06:08.791 --> 00:06:11.316
It's a robot.

00:06:11.393 --> 00:06:13.361
What did you say?

00:06:13.429 --> 00:06:15.021
It's just like me...

00:06:15.097 --> 00:06:17.725
a bioroid
with artificial life.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.291
Is it a prototype?

00:06:20.369 --> 00:06:22.337
Surprises
always come unexpectedly.

00:06:30.713 --> 00:06:33.307
Talk about your family tree.

00:06:33.382 --> 00:06:34.576
It's just another robot.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:36.743
He's not human.

00:06:36.819 --> 00:06:39.549
Would you like to see Asakura?

00:06:39.621 --> 00:06:41.555
Y-Yeah.

00:06:46.795 --> 00:06:48.592
I understand.

00:06:48.664 --> 00:06:50.825
Would you follow me, please?

00:06:54.737 --> 00:06:56.170
Sir, we have visitors.

00:06:58.807 --> 00:06:59.774
Papa!

00:07:01.844 --> 00:07:03.778
Oh!
They finally delivered it.

00:07:03.846 --> 00:07:09.011
I ordered this product
from Conception many years ago.

00:07:09.084 --> 00:07:10.711
My new parts.

00:07:10.786 --> 00:07:11.946
But I'm not...

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:13.487
Papa!

00:07:15.224 --> 00:07:20.127
I can't believe there's
still a prototype of Thirds.

00:07:20.195 --> 00:07:22.425
What is your serial number?

00:07:22.498 --> 00:07:24.295
You must be an early model.

00:07:24.366 --> 00:07:28.200
Your architecture is old now.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.261
Take a look at this.

00:07:30.339 --> 00:07:34.139
This is the latest bioroid.

00:07:34.209 --> 00:07:37.872
There's no longer any need
to copy humans.

00:07:37.946 --> 00:07:39.880
We no longer even
need to categorize them...

00:07:39.948 --> 00:07:41.279
as animal or plant.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.116
This is a new life form...
ALIVE!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.724
It can make
Mars a livable place...

00:07:50.793 --> 00:07:52.192
for humans and animals...

00:07:52.261 --> 00:07:57.494
and someday, it'll become
a real citizen of Mars.

00:07:57.566 --> 00:08:02.594
But those idiots at Conception
don't understand at all!

00:08:02.671 --> 00:08:06.607
Asakura's mind
was unfortunately altered.

00:08:06.675 --> 00:08:09.610
Please don't ask him
about his past.

00:08:09.678 --> 00:08:11.236
It would be painful for him.

00:08:11.313 --> 00:08:14.214
Was his memory erased?

00:08:14.283 --> 00:08:15.545
Who are you?

00:08:15.617 --> 00:08:21.214
I am Wilbur D'anclaude,
Asakura's aide.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.724
He's one
of the assassinroids...

00:08:23.792 --> 00:08:25.953
that Dr. D'anclaude developed.

00:08:26.028 --> 00:08:30.590
He was way too smart,
so I remodeled him.

00:08:30.666 --> 00:08:32.099
He's just joking.

00:08:32.167 --> 00:08:36.604
He upgraded my CPU.

00:08:36.672 --> 00:08:38.765
What's the reason?
- Pardon?

00:08:38.841 --> 00:08:40.502
Why did Dr...

00:08:40.576 --> 00:08:42.601
or just what's
the real purpose of...

00:08:42.678 --> 00:08:43.736
Forget it!

00:08:45.981 --> 00:08:47.676
Let's get out of here.

00:08:56.325 --> 00:08:59.123
Are you still cold?

00:08:59.194 --> 00:09:01.560
My CPU is getting frozen.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:08.092
I don't know if we can
replace your logic board.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:11.537
I don't think I can survive.

00:09:11.607 --> 00:09:16.010
Papa is not sane,
so I can't ask him...

00:09:16.078 --> 00:09:19.514
why I was made,
why Thirds were developed...

00:09:19.581 --> 00:09:23.039
and why all the Thirds
had to be destroyed.

00:09:24.853 --> 00:09:27.151
I'm dying
without knowing anything.

00:09:27.222 --> 00:09:30.191
There's no reason for me
to be alive anymore.

00:09:34.396 --> 00:09:38.298
You don't need reasons to live.

00:09:38.367 --> 00:09:40.733
I don't know about humans...

00:09:40.802 --> 00:09:45.102
but I'm a robot programmed
to be a human.

00:09:45.173 --> 00:09:50.042
I wish I had no brain
to think and worry.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.807
And I wish
I didn't feel pain...

00:09:53.882 --> 00:09:55.349
just like Seconds!

00:09:56.885 --> 00:09:59.319
But you already exist...

00:09:59.388 --> 00:10:03.222
and you have a right
to be alive.

00:10:03.292 --> 00:10:04.782
Am I wrong?

00:10:10.332 --> 00:10:11.492
Sorry.

00:10:21.209 --> 00:10:22.870
Are you sure?

00:10:22.945 --> 00:10:25.436
Don't make me think.

00:10:25.514 --> 00:10:28.483
I'll go crazy
if I start thinking about us.

00:10:29.952 --> 00:10:34.355
But you know my feelings,
don't you?

00:10:41.129 --> 00:10:44.860
But I'm a robot.

00:10:44.933 --> 00:10:48.198
I'm half robot, too.

00:10:51.173 --> 00:10:54.006
Today at 11 a.m.,
Martian time...

00:10:54.076 --> 00:10:58.206
Mars and Earth will finally
sign the new treaty...

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.907
including an economic
aid agreement.

00:10:59.982 --> 00:11:02.382
We are going to step forward...

00:11:02.451 --> 00:11:05.420
into a new era
for the two planets.

00:11:21.336 --> 00:11:24.601
There's something
I'd like to show you.

00:11:27.109 --> 00:11:28.906
Where's the doc?

00:11:28.977 --> 00:11:30.501
He's with his ALIVEs.

00:11:30.579 --> 00:11:33.946
He's concentrating on
further hybridization of ALIVE.

00:11:34.016 --> 00:11:36.450
He intends to complete
the initial terra-forming plans.

00:11:36.518 --> 00:11:39.578
But is it possible?

00:11:39.654 --> 00:11:42.020
No, I don't think so.

00:11:48.997 --> 00:11:52.626
She was supposed
to be your sister.

00:11:52.701 --> 00:11:57.263
Dr. Asakura gave up weapons
production a while back.

00:11:57.339 --> 00:12:01.366
Perhaps that's the reason
he parted with Dr. D'anclaude.

00:12:01.443 --> 00:12:03.070
Don't look.

00:12:03.145 --> 00:12:05.010
Please don't.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.049
Is there something else?

00:12:08.116 --> 00:12:10.983
You may already know that
the Thirds were created...

00:12:11.053 --> 00:12:13.886
based on androids that
were developed for battles.

00:12:13.955 --> 00:12:16.150
You mean assassinroids.

00:12:16.224 --> 00:12:18.988
My brothers and I,
as well as you...

00:12:19.061 --> 00:12:24.590
were the most advanced
model of assassinroid.

00:12:24.666 --> 00:12:26.497
Although our strength
and abilities...

00:12:26.568 --> 00:12:28.001
far surpassed humans...

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:30.868
it was quite simple...

00:12:30.939 --> 00:12:33.464
to assimilate ourselves
into their society.

00:12:38.747 --> 00:12:43.946
Asakura used us as a base
for synthetic organisms...

00:12:44.019 --> 00:12:45.919
in developing the Thirds.

00:12:47.355 --> 00:12:51.553
But all the prototypes
had an imperfection...

00:12:53.028 --> 00:12:55.292
especially
in their mind program.

00:12:55.363 --> 00:13:01.302
And Asakura has been perfecting
a Third by himself.

00:13:01.369 --> 00:13:04.827
L... I am...

00:13:04.906 --> 00:13:06.931
I'm defective!

00:13:07.008 --> 00:13:08.270
Armitage!

00:13:10.412 --> 00:13:14.041
So why were Thirds created...

00:13:14.116 --> 00:13:16.141
robots that can reproduce?

00:13:16.218 --> 00:13:22.157
Do you know the birthrate
has been extremely low here?

00:13:22.224 --> 00:13:24.055
Yeah...

00:13:24.126 --> 00:13:25.821
but what do you mean?

00:13:25.894 --> 00:13:30.490
Any colony
desiring independence...

00:13:30.565 --> 00:13:34.057
requires a populace...

00:13:34.136 --> 00:13:36.070
and Mars will continue
to be weak...

00:13:36.138 --> 00:13:38.072
as long as it
remains dependent...

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:40.040
upon the Earth
for its immigration.

00:13:40.108 --> 00:13:42.076
What about Conception?

00:13:42.144 --> 00:13:43.873
There must be more to it...

00:13:43.945 --> 00:13:45.708
than just the money
that's involved.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.714
For the robot manufacturer...

00:13:47.782 --> 00:13:50.080
the Third project
was very attractive...

00:13:50.152 --> 00:13:54.316
because they could gain strength
through sheer numbers.

00:13:54.389 --> 00:13:59.622
But then the assassinations
make no sense.

00:13:59.694 --> 00:14:01.093
The government hopes
to sign a treaty...

00:14:01.163 --> 00:14:02.130
with the Earth Federation.

00:14:12.908 --> 00:14:14.603
Do you think they've done it?

00:14:14.676 --> 00:14:17.873
The Earth Federation
is now strongly feminist.

00:14:17.946 --> 00:14:22.110
A robot who can conceive
contradicts...

00:14:22.184 --> 00:14:26.780
the Terran Party's position
of basic humanity.

00:14:26.855 --> 00:14:28.186
In addition...

00:14:28.256 --> 00:14:31.555
my brother and I share
the same opinion that...

00:14:31.626 --> 00:14:34.060
robots like Thirds that are
just copies of humans should...

00:14:34.129 --> 00:14:36.757
Should be terminated?

00:14:36.831 --> 00:14:39.629
Is that what you think?

00:14:39.701 --> 00:14:41.931
But, fact is,
I've been existing!

00:14:42.003 --> 00:14:45.439
Your programming
for self-preservation...

00:14:45.507 --> 00:14:50.137
is exactly equal to ours
for eliminating Thirds.

00:14:50.212 --> 00:14:54.876
But, unlike my brothers,
I'd like to help you.

00:14:58.019 --> 00:14:59.145
Hey, Eddie.

00:14:59.221 --> 00:15:01.052
He's on suspension...

00:15:01.122 --> 00:15:03.886
for aiding a fugitive.

00:15:03.959 --> 00:15:06.587
I forced him into it.

00:15:06.661 --> 00:15:11.155
I thought so.

00:15:11.233 --> 00:15:13.064
This Danich Hill Dome...

00:15:13.134 --> 00:15:16.467
has become
a military attack point.

00:15:16.538 --> 00:15:22.340
They say you two are suspects
in the puppet bombings...

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.435
and you've become a threat
to the government.

00:15:24.512 --> 00:15:27.640
Therefore, the army will be
in charge of this case...

00:15:27.716 --> 00:15:30.412
not MPD.

00:15:30.485 --> 00:15:31.975
I hope you didn't turn us in.

00:15:32.053 --> 00:15:34.613
No way! I forced Eddie
to tell me where you are...

00:15:34.689 --> 00:15:36.623
and warn you
about an attack in advance.

00:15:36.691 --> 00:15:38.386
Shit!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.052
Armitage.

00:15:41.329 --> 00:15:45.823
What do you want me to do,
surrender or what?

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.391
Please surrender.

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:50.335
We're waiting for you.

00:15:50.405 --> 00:15:52.373
See you later.

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.600
Good luck.

00:15:56.478 --> 00:15:58.412
What now?

00:15:59.514 --> 00:16:01.948
We have to get my father out.

00:16:02.117 --> 00:16:04.585
Today is our day of new hope.

00:16:04.619 --> 00:16:07.952
We are about
to leave behind...

00:16:08.023 --> 00:16:10.423
our old cultural
and social paradigm.

00:16:10.492 --> 00:16:15.896
Earth Federation Chairwoman
Everheart is going to...

00:16:15.964 --> 00:16:18.432
launch various
new projects here.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.899
One world, one nation.

00:16:19.968 --> 00:16:24.337
We are now about to be reborn
as a unified humanity.

00:16:24.406 --> 00:16:27.773
Listen. They're going
to blow all of us up.

00:16:27.842 --> 00:16:31.107
ALIVEs cannot live
outside of this dome yet.

00:16:31.179 --> 00:16:32.737
I cannot leave here now.

00:16:32.814 --> 00:16:34.679
They are going to kill us.

00:16:34.749 --> 00:16:35.977
Papa!

00:16:36.051 --> 00:16:39.145
Wilbur, check the cells
of the fourth generation.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.246
Papa! I don't care if you
forget about me, but please...

00:16:52.067 --> 00:16:53.227
Doctor...

00:16:55.036 --> 00:16:57.732
Police orders... evacuate.

00:17:03.378 --> 00:17:07.144
You're still a little fireball,
aren't you, Naomi?

00:17:09.718 --> 00:17:11.310
Papa!

00:17:18.693 --> 00:17:20.524
Papa...

00:17:20.595 --> 00:17:25.623
I'm sorry, Naomi.
I'm a great coward.

00:17:28.036 --> 00:17:29.298
You poor child.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:36.374
I will fix you once more
for the last time.

00:17:39.581 --> 00:17:42.311
Now you're real.

00:17:59.801 --> 00:18:04.170
We are now awakened
as new Martians...

00:18:04.239 --> 00:18:06.639
in the happiness of living
in peace and harmony...

00:18:44.379 --> 00:18:47.371
Do you want to go to Earth
by cargo shuttle?

00:18:47.449 --> 00:18:50.247
I can get you a new I.D.
Somehow.

00:18:50.318 --> 00:18:51.478
I'm going back to the city.

00:18:51.553 --> 00:18:55.649
I don't want to run away.

00:19:10.905 --> 00:19:12.395
We'll say goodbye here.

00:19:13.508 --> 00:19:16.671
You can go back to Earth, Ross.

00:19:16.744 --> 00:19:19.577
You don't have to hang out
with me.

00:19:19.647 --> 00:19:22.081
I want you to live!

00:19:24.652 --> 00:19:25.584
Ross...

00:19:25.653 --> 00:19:30.920
This whole city
hates your kind...

00:19:30.992 --> 00:19:32.425
without any reason.

00:19:32.494 --> 00:19:34.018
I know.

00:19:34.095 --> 00:19:35.528
I know, so...

00:19:35.597 --> 00:19:38.065
if I run away from them...

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.961
That's what they want.

00:19:51.779 --> 00:19:54.543
If you go back...

00:19:54.616 --> 00:19:56.550
I'll always be with you.

00:20:11.432 --> 00:20:14.333
Thank you for coming, sir.

00:20:14.402 --> 00:20:16.461
Chairwoman Everheart's car
has just turned...

00:20:16.538 --> 00:20:18.005
onto St. Lowell Street...

00:20:18.072 --> 00:20:20.472
going through the center
of the city.

00:20:20.542 --> 00:20:23.943
Her bright smile proves
that she will solve...

00:20:24.012 --> 00:20:28.381
all kinds of problems
between the two nations.

00:20:28.449 --> 00:20:30.940
One world, one nation.

00:20:31.019 --> 00:20:33.214
One world, one nation.

00:21:07.689 --> 00:21:09.156
Here they come.

00:21:23.171 --> 00:21:24.763
Hey, Ross...

00:21:26.007 --> 00:21:29.943
we're not going to die
this time, are we?

00:21:30.011 --> 00:21:31.171
No.

00:21:34.983 --> 00:21:35.950
Let's go.

00:24:26.854 --> 00:24:29.652
A new era in Martian history
has just started.

00:24:29.724 --> 00:24:34.559
The new treaty has been
signed, and we are now...

00:25:00.321 --> 00:25:01.879
Welcome back to Mars.

00:25:14.035 --> 00:25:16.435
Ross...

00:25:16.504 --> 00:25:18.768
you look skinnier.

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:23.607
Remember?
I told you I love hunks.

00:25:25.680 --> 00:25:26.612
What's this?

00:25:26.681 --> 00:25:29.616
A human I.D. Card
issued on Earth.

00:25:29.684 --> 00:25:33.347
This proves that you're
a registered Earth citizen.

00:25:33.421 --> 00:25:37.517
With just a piece of paper?

00:25:37.592 --> 00:25:40.561
Annalisa... Bradford?

00:25:40.628 --> 00:25:43.620
That's your name from now on.

00:25:43.698 --> 00:25:45.791
Maybe if I had a bunch
of these to begin with...

00:25:45.867 --> 00:25:48.392
all the other Thirds
wouldn't have had to die.

00:25:52.640 --> 00:25:54.073
Hey! What are you doing?

00:25:54.141 --> 00:25:55.574
What are you going to do?

00:25:55.643 --> 00:25:57.508
You want me to go back?

00:25:57.578 --> 00:26:00.547
No. Forget it.

00:26:00.615 --> 00:26:01.980
The name sucks anyway.

00:26:06.854 --> 00:26:09.789
Would you
like to go visit Julian?

00:26:09.857 --> 00:26:12.155
We haven't seen him since...

00:26:12.226 --> 00:26:13.989
No, not yet.

00:26:14.061 --> 00:26:18.157
Well, let's go
when we become three.

00:26:24.238 --> 00:26:27.105
Under my logic board.
Get it?

00:26:32.179 --> 00:26:34.113
Yeah...

00:26:34.181 --> 00:26:36.775
I'll be a dad!

00:26:36.851 --> 00:26:40.719
I've finally become
a complete Third.
